-- N1 example sentences, batch 5: the last eleven writable topics.
--
-- 〜において, 〜を通じて, 〜ゆえに and 〜がゆえに (the plain cause and the
-- emphatic one, written next to each other), 〜とて, 〜よりほかない,
-- どうにも〜ない, 〜にしろ〜にしろ, 〜ひとつで, 〜始末だ and 〜たところで.
--
-- Three rewordings:
--
--   一年を通じて warned on 一|年 — two single kanji the index does not hold as
--   a compound, the same shape N3 batch 1 hit on 十年. The sentence is about
--   television and the world instead.
--
--   止められない shredded to 止め|ら|れ|ない, a potential negative one
--   inflection past what the index reaches; どうにもならない says the same
--   thing and cuts clean.
--
--   生きてきた lost き|た — 〜てくる in the past has no entry — so it is
--   生きている.
--
-- After this seed, four N1 topics remain uncovered, all recorded in seeds 129
-- and 133: 〜を余儀なくされる (余儀 splits to 余|儀), 〜ところを and
-- 〜うが〜まいが (the pattern ends in a particle, which check:examples reads
-- as a swallowed one), and 〜まい (shreds to ま|い everywhere). Each needs a
-- lexicon entry rather than a different sentence. 51 of 55.
--
-- Additive, idempotent, safe on a live database.

